  "title": "Guidewire’s Approach to Predictive Analytics, Part Six: Enabling a Smart Core System",
  "summary": "It has been difficult for the insurance industry to formulate a proper vision for their use of predictive analytics. Executives who set their company’s direction tend not to understand the scope of what is possible and lack direct experience with the benefits and challenges. Conversely, those who do have more experience and understanding tend not to be in a position to establish a corporate-wide vision.",
